n.dc.html","Phone.dc.html","InboxWatching.dc.html","InboxWatchingPhone.dc.html","InboxTeam.dc.html","InboxTeamPhone.dc.html","NewMemo.dc.html","NewMemoPhone.dc.html","Draft.dc.html","DraftPhone.dc.html","Sent.dc.html","SentPhone.dc.html","Memo.dc.html","MemoPhone.dc.html","Returned.dc.html","ReturnedPhone.dc.html","Approved.dc.html","ApprovedPhone.dc.html","Closed.dc.html","ClosedPhone.dc.html","Rejected.dc.html","RejectedPhone.dc.html","Withdrawn.dc.html","WithdrawnPhone.dc.html","Cancelled.dc.html","CancelledPhone.dc.html","Discarded.dc.html","DiscardedPhone.dc.html","Imported.dc.html","ImportedPhone.dc.html","Document.dc.html","DocumentPhone.dc.html","MemoParts.dc.html","MemoPartsPhone.dc.html","MemoDialogs.dc.html","MemoDialogsPhone.dc.html","StepUp.dc.html","StepUpPhone.dc.html","Search.dc.html","SearchPhone.dc.html","Saved.dc.html","SavedPhone.dc.html","Notifications.dc.html","NotificationsPhone.dc.html","Dashboard.dc.html","DashboardPhone.dc.html","Org.dc.html","OrgPhone.dc.html","Position.dc.html","PositionPhone.dc.html","Security.dc.html","SecurityPhone.dc.html","Prefs.dc.html","PrefsPhone.dc.html","SignIn.dc.html","SignInPhone.dc.html","Status.dc.html","StatusPhone.dc.html","States.dc.html","StatesPhone.dc.html","Tasks.dc.html","TasksPhone.dc.html","Rules.dc.html"],"notes":{"inboxTitle":{"x":0,"y":-240,"text":"Inbox · My tasks","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"apiChanges":{"x":2030,"y":0,"w":620,"fill":"orange","size":"m","text":"API changes this design needs\n\nInbox (GET /api/v1/inbox/tasks)\n1. Counts — total open tasks for the My tasks tab, the sidebar Inbox badge and the \"x of N selected\" footer.\n2. Action per task — DECIDE does not say whether the step is Approve or Recommend.\n3. Memo type — add the memo type's name to InboxMemo.\n4. Sender — who sent the task (previous holder or author).\n5. Filters — text (subject or reference), memo type, due (overdue / due soon / none), working with sort and the cursor.\n\nNotifications (GET /api/v1/me/notifications)\n6. Filters — unread only, and category (approvals, following, security, administration), working with the cursor.\n7. Context — the second line needs a little more in params: the memo subject, a snippet of the note that mentions you, the sign-in place and browser.\n\nWatching (GET /api/v1/inbox/watching)\n8. Status — add the memo's status to WatchingItem, so the list can show In review / Approved / Closed without opening each memo.\n\nAny request (all of /api/v1)\n9. Session ended — when a session has ended (timed out, signed out elsewhere, or ended from My security), answer 401 with a problem reason that says so, e.g. SESSION_ENDED, so the app shows “You were signed out” instead of “Something went wrong”."},"behaviour":{"x":2030,"y":960,"w":620,"fill":"blue","size":"m","text":"Behaviour notes\n\n• Team tab appears only for people who oversee a unit (as today); everyone else sees five tabs.\n• Organisation name and logo come from tenant branding; it is a label, not a switcher.\n• Under the user's name we show the email: the user record has no job title.\n• Row \"⋯\" menu: Claim, Release, Watch for that one task (existing endpoints).\n• Show more loads the next batch by cursor; 50 per batch on desktop, 25 on phones.\n• Forms validate in the app (TanStack Form), never with browser HTML validation: noValidate on every form, our own messages under the field, focus to the first error, submit stays enabled.\n• New states the app does not handle yet: Page not found (unknown address), Connection lost (offline bar) and Signed out (session ended mid-task). See the Page states row."},"memoTitle":{"x":0,"y":9280,"text":"Memo in review (approver)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"newMemoTitle":{"x":0,"y":4320,"text":"New memo","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"draftTitle":{"x":0,"y":5940,"text":"Draft (initiator)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"approvedTitle":{"x":0,"y":12520,"text":"Approved memo","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"rejectedTitle":{"x":0,"y":15760,"text":"Rejected memo (initiator)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"returnedTitle":{"x":0,"y":10900,"text":"Returned memo (initiator)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"notifTitle":{"x":0,"y":41280,"text":"Notifications","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"searchTitle":{"x":0,"y":38140,"text":"Search","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"savedTitle":{"x":0,"y":39760,"text":"Saved searches","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"dashTitle":{"x":0,"y":42900,"text":"Approvals dashboard","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"tasksTitle":{"x":0,"y":56960,"text":"Open tasks (administration)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"homeTitle":{"x":0,"y":-1860,"text":"Home","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"docTitle":{"x":0,"y":23860,"text":"Document","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"secTitle":{"x":0,"y":47660,"text":"My security","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"prefsTitle":{"x":0,"y":49180,"text":"Notification settings","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"signinTitle":{"x":0,"y":50700,"text":"Sign in, reset password, two-step setup, invitation","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"importedTitle":{"x":0,"y":22240,"text":"Imported memo","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"statusTitle":{"x":0,"y":52220,"text":"Platform status","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"orgTitle":{"x":0,"y":44620,"text":"Organisation","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"positionTitle":{"x":0,"y":46140,"text":"Position","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"withdrawnTitle":{"x":0,"y":17380,"text":"Withdrawn memo","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"cancelledTitle":{"x":0,"y":19000,"text":"Cancelled memo","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"discardedTitle":{"x":0,"y":20620,"text":"Discarded draft","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"sentTitle":{"x":0,"y":7660,"text":"Your memo in review (initiator)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"closedTitle":{"x":0,"y":14140,"text":"Closed memo","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"memoDialogsTitle":{"x":0,"y":32200,"text":"Memo dialogs","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"InboxWatchingTitle":{"x":0,"y":1280,"text":"Inbox · Watching","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"InboxTeamTitle":{"x":0,"y":2800,"text":"Inbox · Team (unit heads and people given the team view)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"StepUpTitle":{"x":0,"y":36420,"text":"Confirm it is you (step-up)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"StatesTitle":{"x":0,"y":53740,"text":"Page states","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"buildNote":{"x":2030,"y":1800,"w":620,"fill":"blue","size":"m","text":"Build note\n\nUse shadcn/ui components for everything: Button, Input, InputOTP, Select, Combobox, Tabs, Table, Dialog, Drawer, AlertDialog, DropdownMenu, Popover, Badge, Skeleton, Alert, Sonner, Sidebar. These boards are hand-written HTML only because the canvas cannot run React; do not copy their inline styles. The component for each pattern is listed on the Design rules page, section 1."},"memoPartsTitle":{"x":0,"y":25380,"text":"Memo page parts","kind":"title1","maxW":1910}},"designSystems":[]}